orted in this report are statistically significant at p<0.0001.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Data were analyzed by race/ethnicity.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Records with missing information on the mother's place of birth\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Gestational age was computed from the date of the mother's last menstrual period\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}